{"page":235,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:118","surah":11,"ayah":118,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ شَآءَ رَبُّكَ لَجَعَلَ ٱلنَّاسَ أُمَّةً وَٰحِدَةً ۖ وَلَا يَزَالُونَ مُخْتَلِفِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If your Lord had pleased, He would have made all people a single community, but they continue to have their differences-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"your Lord (had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord (had) willed","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"surely He (could) have made","transliteration":"lajaʿala","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"one community","transliteration":"ummatan","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"one community","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَزَالُونَ","en_gloss":"they will cease","transliteration":"yazālūna","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُخْتَلِفِينَ","en_gloss":"to differ","transliteration":"mukh'talifīna","verse_key":"11:118"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١١٨","en_gloss":"(118)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:118"}]},{"verse_key":"11:119","surah":11,"ayah":119,"ar_uthmani":"إِلَّا مَن رَّحِمَ رَبُّكَ ۚ وَلِذَٰلِكَ خَلَقَهُمْ ۗ وَتَمَّتْ كَلِمَةُ رَبِّكَ لَأَمْلَأَنَّ جَهَنَّمَ مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ أَجْمَعِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"except those on whom your Lord has mercy- for He created them to be this way, and the word of your Lord is final: ‘I shall definitely fill Hell with both jinn and men.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"Except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(on) whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَّحِمَ","en_gloss":"your Lord has bestowed Mercy","transliteration":"raḥima","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبُّكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"your Lord has bestowed Mercy","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلِذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"and for that","transliteration":"walidhālika","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلَقَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"He created them","transliteration":"khalaqahum","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَتَمَّتْ","en_gloss":"And will be fulfilled","transliteration":"watammat","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَلِمَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) Word of your Lord","transliteration":"kalimatu","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"(the) Word of your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"Surely I will fill","transliteration":"la-amla-anna","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْجِنَّةِ","en_gloss":"the Jinn","transliteration":"l-jinati","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"and the men","transliteration":"wal-nāsi","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَجْمَعِينَ","en_gloss":"all together","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","verse_key":"11:119"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١١٩","en_gloss":"(119)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:119"}]},{"verse_key":"11:120","surah":11,"ayah":120,"ar_uthmani":"وَكُلًّا نَّقُصُّ عَلَيْكَ مِنْ أَنۢبَآءِ ٱلرُّسُلِ مَا نُثَبِّتُ بِهِۦ فُؤَادَكَ ۚ وَجَآءَكَ فِى هَـٰذِهِ ٱلْحَقُّ وَمَوْعِظَةٌ وَذِكْرَىٰ لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Muhammad], We have told you the stories of the prophets to make your heart firm and in these accounts truth has come to you, as well as lessons and reminders for the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكُلًّۭا","en_