e of what you [people] are doing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":2,"ar":"غَيْبُ","en_gloss":"(is the) unseen","transliteration":"ghaybu","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"and to Him","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"will be returned","transliteration":"yur'jaʿu","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amru","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"all (of) it","transliteration":"kulluhu","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَٱعْبُدْهُ","en_gloss":"so worship Him","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'bud'hu","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","en_gloss":"and put your trust","transliteration":"watawakkal","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"upon Him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And your Lord is not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"And your Lord is not","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِغَـٰفِلٍ","en_gloss":"unaware","transliteration":"bighāfilin","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"11:123"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٢٣","en_gloss":"(123)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:123"}]},{"verse_key":"12:1","surah":12,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" الٓر ۚ تِلْكَ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ٱلْمُبِينِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Alif Lam Ra These are the verses of the Scripture that makes things clear––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"الٓر ۚ","en_gloss":"Alif Laam Ra","transliteration":"alif-lam-ra","verse_key":"12:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تِلْكَ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"12:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(are the) Verses","transliteration":"āyātu","verse_key":"12:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"12:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينِ","en_gloss":"[the] clear","transliteration":"l-mubīni","verse_key":"12:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:1"}]},{"verse_key":"12:2","surah":12,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ قُرْءَٰنًا عَرَبِيًّا لَّعَلَّكُمْ تَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent it down as an Arabic Quran so that you [people] may understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have sent it down","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُرْءَٰنًا","en_gloss":"(as) a Quran in Arabic","transliteration":"qur'ānan","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَرَبِيًّۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a Quran in Arabic","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","verse_key":"12:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:2"}]},{"verse_key":"12:3","surah":12,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"نَحْنُ نَقُصُّ عَلَيْكَ أَحْسَنَ ٱلْقَصَصِ بِمَآ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانَ وَإِن كُنتَ مِن قَبْلِهِۦ لَمِنَ ٱلْغَـٰفِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We tell you [Prophet] the best of stories in revealing this Quran to you. Before this you were one of those who knew nothing about them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَقُصُّ","en_gloss":"relate","transliteration":"naquṣṣu","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"the best","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقَصَصِ","en_gloss":"of the narrations","transliteration":"l-qaṣaṣi","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"(of) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"although","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَبْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَمِنَ","en_gloss":"surely among","transliteration":"lamina","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰفِلِينَ","en_gloss":"the unaware","transliteration":"l-ghāfilīna","verse_key":"12:3"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:3"}]},{"verse_key":"12:4","surah":12,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ قَالَ يُوسُفُ لِأَبِيهِ يَـٰٓأَبَتِ إِنِّى رَأَيْتُ أَحَدَ عَشَرَ كَوْكَبًا وَٱلشَّمْسَ وَٱلْقَمَرَ رَأَيْتُهُمْ لِى سَـٰجِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Joseph said to his father, ‘Father, I dreamed of eleven stars and the sun and the moon: I saw them all bow down before me,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"12:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":